        "text_jUByfz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Milano Jewelry is a fine jewelry brand specializing in lab-grown diamond engagement rings, gemstone jewelry, wedding bands, and everyday fine jewelry. Designed for modern consumers, Milano combines timeless craftsmanship with ethical sourcing, offering high-quality pieces at accessible prices.</p><p>Known for its customizable engagement rings and contemporary designs, Milano Jewelry features a curated selection of lab-grown diamonds, colored gemstone jewelry, and recycled precious metals, making it a sustainable and conscious choice.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
