            "image_width": 310,
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "text_hNnGUx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Milano Jewelry operates both online and in retail locations, delivering a seamless shopping experience with expert guidance, transparent pricing, and a strong focus on customer trust.<br/>Whether you're searching for a lab-grown diamond ring, gemstone jewelry, fine jewelry gift, or a custom engagement ring, Milano Jewelry offers elegant, high-quality pieces designed to last a lifetime.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "subheading_qr9FnA": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "WHY PARTNER WITH US"
          }
        },
        "text_DTttYG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With <strong>400,000+ customers served</strong> and a presence across <strong>35+ retail locations</strong>, Milano Jewelry is a trusted brand your audience will feel confident purchasing from. Our <strong>in-house manufacturing and rich craftsmanship</strong> ensure every piece meets the highest standards of quality — making Milano a strong, high-converting referral for fine jewelry, engagement rings, and gemstone jewelry.<br/><br/>As an affiliate partner, you benefit from a brand that already is desirable — backed by strong retail presence, proven demand, and customer trust.<br/><br/><strong>The Milano Jewelry Affiliate Program offers:</strong><br/>Competitive Commission Payouts – Earn on every successful referral across our full range of fine jewelry, engagement rings, and gemstone pieces<br/>30-Day Cookie Window – Get credited for conversions within 30 days of referral<br/>High Average Order Value – Maximize earnings with premium product pricing<br/>Exclusive Promotions & Campaign Updates – Stay informed on upcoming launches and offers<br/>Dedicated Affiliate Support – We’re here to help you succeed<br/><br/><br/>Fees and commissions are paid monthly. Payments are net of any customer returns, cancellations, shipping fees, and applicable taxes.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "subheading_VEtWwb": {
